<title>USA: SQUASH-TOURNAMENT OF CHAMPIONS SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-TOURNAMENT OF CHAMPIONS SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the</p>
<p>Tournament of Champions on Sunday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>Craig Rowland (Australia) beat 1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) 15-10</p>
<p>15-7 15-13</p>
<p>Jonathan Power (Canada) beat 4-Peter Nicol (Scotland) 15-4 15-7</p>
<p>13-15 15-13</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>3-Cassie Jackman (England) beat 1-Michelle Martin (Australia)</p>
<p>9-2 5-9 10-8 9-3</p>
<p>4-Liz Irving (Australia) beat 2-Suzanne Horner (England) 9-1</p>
<p>retired</p>
</text>
